2.25.1

Add pinctrl driver for StarFive JHB100 SoC System-0(sys0) pinctrl
controller.

Simultaneously add a generic pinctrl driver framework for registering
the pinctrl of other domains (sys1, sys2, and so on) in the JHB100 SoC.

