+	 * Changing the type of the system call stop is not allowed, with the
+	 * following exception:
+	 * PTRACE_SYSCALL_INFO_SECCOMP can be changed to PTRACE_SYSCALL_INFO_EXIT
+	 * to skip the system call
+	 */
